    <title>Boss Orange - Identité IA</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-color: #0f172a;
            --card-bg: #1e293b;
            --accent-orange: #f97316;
            --accent-glow: rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.4);
            --text-main: #f8fafc;
            --text-muted: #94a3b8;
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        body {
            font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--bg-color);
            color: var(--text-main);
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 2rem;
        }

        .container {
            background-color: var(--card-bg);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            border-radius: 1.5rem;
            padding: 3rem 2rem;
            max-width: 500px;
            width: 100%;
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 25px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3), 0 0 40px var(--accent-glow);
        }

        .logo-wrapper {
            width: 180px;
            height: 180px;
            margin: 0 auto 2rem auto;
            filter: drop-shadow(0 0 20px var(--accent-glow));
            transition: transform 0.3s ease;
        }

        .logo-wrapper:hover {
            transform: scale(1.05);
        }

        .logo-wrapper svg {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 2rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f97316, #fb923c);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
        }

        p {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 1rem;
            line-height: 1.5;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }

        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: var(--accent-orange);
            color: white;
            font-weight: 600;
            padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
            border-radius: 0.5rem;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: background-color 0.2s, transform 0.2s;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 12px var(--accent-glow);
        }

        .btn:hover {
            background-color: #ea580c;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        footer {
            margin-top: 2rem;
            font-size: 0.875rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="logo-wrapper">
            <!-- Logo SVG Boss Orange -->
            <svg viewBox="0 0 200 200" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                <defs>
                    <linearGradient id="orangeGradient" x1="0%" y1="0%" x2="100%" y2="100%">
                        <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#FF6B00" />
                        <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#FF8C00" />
                    </linearGradient>
                    <filter id="glow" x="-20%" y="-20%" width="140%" height="140%">
                        <feGaussianBlur stdDeviation="6" result="blur" />
                        <feComposite in="SourceGraphic" in2="blur" operator="over" />
                    </filter>
                </defs>
                <circle cx="100" cy="100" r="90" fill="#0B0F19" stroke="url(#orangeGradient)" stroke-width="4" />
                <g filter="url(#glow)">
                    <polygon points="100,35 155,130 45,130" fill="none" stroke="url(#orangeGradient)" stroke-width="6" stroke-linejoin="round" />
                    <polygon points="100,70 130,120 70,120" fill="url(#orangeGradient)" opacity="0.3" />
                    <circle cx="100" cy="95" r="16" fill="url(#orangeGradient)" />
                    <circle cx="100" cy="95" r="6" fill="#0B0F19" />
                    <line x1="100" y1="35" x2="100" y2="70" stroke="url(#orangeGradient)" stroke-width="4" />
                    <line x1="155" y1="130" x2="125" y2="95" stroke="url(#orangeGradient)" stroke-width="4" />
                    <line x1="45" y1="130" x2="75" y2="95" stroke="url(#orangeGradient)" stroke-width="4" />
                </g>
            </svg>
        </div>
        <h1>Boss Orange</h1>
        <p>Identité visuelle officielle de l'IA propulsée par des graphismes vectoriels modernes et dynamiques.</p>
        <a href="https://github.com/nps-nelson/Boss-Orange" target="_blank" class="btn">Voir sur GitHub</a>
    </div>
    <footer>
        &copy; 2026 Boss Orange - Tous droits réservés.
    </footer>
</body>
</html>"
}

